WEBVTT

00:12:28.953 --> 00:12:30.896
but beauty and art as well,

00:12:30.920 --> 00:12:34.260
everything, all at once, just like life,

00:12:34.284 --> 00:12:36.272
flickering and smoldering

00:12:36.296 --> 00:12:38.662
and burning and dazzling,

00:12:40.193 --> 00:12:44.937
and somehow, in the middle of it,
finding a way to dance ...

00:12:44.961 --> 00:12:46.225
me.

00:12:46.249 --> 00:12:47.539
Thank you.